            "detailed_description": "In the year of 18XX, the west is overrun by thugs and outlaws. A group of bandits have kidnapped Mayor Johnsons daughter and are spreading havok across the land. Only Gunman Clive can bring order to the west and save the girl!<br><br>Jump and shoot your way across 16 diverse and challenging levels and fight massive bosses. Gunman Clive is an old-school sidescrolling platform game set in the old west with full 3D graphics and a unique artstyle.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Old school sidescrolling action<br></li><li>Full 3D graphics<br></li><li>Unique sketch shaded artstyle<br></li><li>3 different playable characters<br></li><li>Dozens of different enemies<br></li><li>Epic boss battles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Supports Xbox 360 controllers</li></ul>",
